cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this research toolkit helps your work on the puzzle, please cite it."
title: "Echo's Quest For Wisdom — Bitcoin Steganography Puzzle: reproducible research toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - name: cinclancr
repository-code: "https://github.com/cinclancr/Echos-Quest-For-Wisdom-Puzzle"
abstract: >-
  Read-only, reproducible investigation of the publicly announced Bitcoin
  steganography puzzle "Echo's Quest For Wisdom": source integrity,
  tokenisation, positional tables, extraction-hypothesis registry, BIP39 /
  BIP32 / Electrum derivation checks, and checksum-agnostic permutation
  scanners.
keywords:
  - bitcoin
  - steganography
  - bip39
  - cryptanalysis
  - word-puzzle
  - python
  - reproducible-research
license: MIT
